"iPhone11,6\":49972224,\"iPhone8,4\":49927168,\"iPhone11,4\":49972224,\"iPhone8,1\":49927168,\"iPhone8,2\":49972224,\"iPad14,4-B\":49507328,\"iPhone15,5\":49552384,\"iPhone15,4\":49552384,\"iPhone11,8\":49939456,\"iPhone15,3\":49552384,\"iPad14,4-A\":49507328,\"iPad5,4\":49927168,\"iPad13,10\":49927168,\"iPad5,3\":49927168,\"iPad5,2\":49927168,\"iPad5,1\":49927168,\"iPad6,11\":49927168,\"iPad6,12\":49927168,\"MacFamily20,1\":49927168,\"iPad12,1\":49507328,\"iPad12,2\":49507328,\"iPhone10,3\":49972224,\"iPhone10,2\":49972224,\"iPhone10,1\":49927168,\"iPhone14,3\":49552384,\"iPhone14,2\":49552384,\"iPhone10,6\":49972224,\"iPhone10,5\":49972224,\"iPhone10,4\":49927168,\"iPad13,19\":49507328,\"iPhone14,7\":49552384,\"iPad14,5-A\":49507328,\"iPhone14,6\":49507328,\"iPad14,5-B\":49507328,\"iPhone14,5\":49552384,\"iPad13,11\":49927168,\"iPhone14,4\":49552384,\"iPad13,17\":49507328,\"iPad13,18\":49507328,\"universal\":51539968,\"iPod9,1\":49927168,\"iPhone14,8\":49552384,\"iPad13,16\":49507328,\"iPad6,7\":49927168,\"iPad6,4\":49927168,\"iPad6,3\":49927168,\"iPad6,8\":49927168,\"iPad13,8\":49927168,\"iPad13,9\":49927168,\"iPad13,4\":49927168,\"iPad13,5\":49927168,\"iPad13,6\":49927168,\"iPad13,7\":49927168,\"iPad13,1\":49927168,\"iPad13,2\":49927168}},\"relationships\":{\"app-events\":{\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/6443918070/app-events?l=en-US\",\"data\":[]},\"reviews\":{\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/6443918070/reviews?l=en-US\",\"next\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/6443918070/reviews?l=en-US\u0026offset=10\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"9475276997\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2023-01-05T21:22:57Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"id\":34150130,\"body\":\"Thank you so much for taking the time to review HabitKit and for sharing your experience! I appreciate your support and am grateful that you have chosen to use HabitKit. Thank you for your review, and I hope you continue to find success with the app.\",\"modified\":\"2023-01-08T08:18:03Z\"},\"review\":\"I absolutely love HabitKit! It is by far the best habit tracking app I have ever used. The tile-based grid charts make it super easy to visualize my progress, and the customization options for the dashboard are a great touch. The ability to choose my own colors, icons, and descriptions really helps me to personalize the app to my own needs and goals.\\n\\nOne of the things I love most about HabitKit is the motivation it provides. Seeing the tiles on my dashboard fill up with color as I complete my habits is a great way to stay motivated and on track. The app is also very user-friendly and easy to navigate. I highly recommend HabitKit to anyone looking to form new habits or break old ones.\\n\\nOverall, I would give HabitKit a solid 5 out of 5 stars. It has truly made a difference in my life and I am so grateful to have found it. Thank you, Sebastian, for creating such a wonderful app!\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"userName\":\"Chevy Phillip\",\"title\":\"The Ultimate Habit Tracking App!\"}},{\"id\":\"9474887392\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2023-01-05T18:44:20Z\",\"review\":\"I absolutely love HabitKit. It is by far the best habit tracking app I have ever used. The tile-based grid charts make it super easy to visualize my progress, and the customization options for the dashboard are a great touch. The ability to choose my own colors, icons, and descriptions really helps me to personalize the app to my own needs and goals.\\n\\nOne of the things I love most about HabitKit is the motivation it provides. Seeing the tiles on my dashboard fill up with color as I complete my habits is a great way to stay motivated and on track. The app is also very user-friendly and easy to navigate. I highly recommend HabitKit to anyone looking to form new habits or break old ones.\\n\\nOverall, I would give HabitKit a solid 5 out of 5 stars. It has truly made a difference in my life and I am so grateful to have found it. Thank you, for creating such a wonderful app!\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"title\":\"The Ultimate Habit Tracking App!\",\"userName\":\"Chevy Phillip\"}},{\"id\":\"9859117108\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2023-04-25T10:34:34Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"id\":36222346,\"body\":\"Thank you very much! It really means a lot to me that you've taken the time to write such an extensive review of my app. I'm really glad that the app had a positive effect on your life and I hope you'll stick with all the habits you created.\\n\\nThanks again and all the best, Sebastian\",\"modified\":\"2023-04-28T09:12:29Z\"},\"review\":\"As someone who has always struggled with maintaining consistency in my daily habits, I have tried numerous habit tracking apps in the past. However, none of them have managed to motivate and engage me as much as HabitKit! This app has completely transformed my approach to habit tracking and has helped me build lasting habits that I can finally stick to.\\n\\nThe daily notifications are a gentle but effective reminder to complete my habits, making it nearly impossible to forget or procrastinate. The best part, though, is the GitHub contribution-style chart that visually represents my progress. This brilliant feature has turned habit tracking into an exciting game, where I eagerly work to maintain my streak and fill in the chart.\\n\\nThe interface is clean, intuitive, and user-friendly, allowing me to easily add, edit, and manage my habits. The customization options are also impressive, enabling me to tailor the notifications and chart according to my preferences.\\n\\nHabitKit has not only helped me stay consistent in my daily routines but has also significantly improved my productivity and overall well-being. I am genuinely grateful for this app and highly recommend it to anyone looking to build and maintain healthy habits. Give HabitKit a try, and I promise you won't be disappointed!\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"userName\":\"upsetti with this spagetti\",\"title\":\"Effective and Motivating Habit Tracker!\"}},{\"id\":\"10938500677\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2024-02-14T17:13:41Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"id\":42020449,\"body\":\"Thank you very much for the great review! I'm currently working on a big widget revamp, so stay tuned for that!\",\"modified\":\"2024-02-18T07:34:21Z\"},\"review\":\"Tried so many habit tracking apps. And there are a lot of great ones out there but this is probably my favorite. I like the inutitve ui, simple easy to use which keeps me coming back. The set up is prob gonna take the longest and the fight for myself in many apps. But this one its easy, once set up i keep adding new ones as needed. \\n\\nAdd more widget sizes, possibly customization options is the only thing i ask for so hopefully thats in the future roadmap. As i like to see more than one habit without launching full app. \\n\\nThank you for the awesome app, i swear. This has been godsend.\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"userName\":\"Mr Kreus\",\"title\":\"Favorite Habit App Tried Many\"}},{\"id\":\"9508254597\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2023-01-15T01:07:29Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"id\":34301376,\"body\":\"Thank you for your review! I'm really glad to hear that HabitKit feels right for you and that you like the visual display of your streak. Thanks for using HabitKit!\",\"modified\":\"2023-01-16T07:07:46Z\"},\"review\":\"I’ve been using the “don’t break the chain” method of habit building for about a billion years. I’ve used apps and my own paper trackers. They all work, more or less, but some just feel better than others, and with something simple like habit tracking, feel is 90% of what’s important.\\n\\nHabitKit has FEEL son!\\n\\nThere’s something about the simplicity of the app and the ease of logging that just feels right. But more than that, the visual display of your streak is the best I’ve come across. It’s RIGHT in your face. There’s no ignoring it… and that’s a very very good thing.\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"userName\":\"dörkåsbord\",\"title\":\"Fresh take on an old style of habit tracking\"}},{\"id\":\"9410648676\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2022-12-18T21:53:44Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"id\":33834604,\"body\":\"Thank you for your positive review of HabitKit!  I'm glad that you find the app to be a good value at its current price point. I hope that HabitKit continues to be a helpful tool for you as you work towards your goals. Thank you for your support!\",\"modified\":\"2022-12-20T14:39:39Z\"},\"review\":\"HabitKit is an exciting app. It's gorgeous to see, it's a joy to use, it may well be best in class. Also: The developer is friendly and responsive to feature requests... HabitKit has arrived just in time for the new year; I expect to use the app each- and every day... I'm happy to see that it's buyable (subscription not required!) and right now, priced at just 15 bucks, it's well worth it too... Give this app a try -- it's great already and it'll get only better!\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"title\":\"Great app, great price\",\"userName\":\"Wooooooooooooooo0\"}},{\"id\":\"10899303798\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2024-02-04T04:26:54Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"id\":42020541,\"body\":\"Thank you very much for the great review and the feedback! I'm currently working on a big widget revamp and will add interactivity. Unfortunately, I can't make the app free because it's my sole income. Hope you understand it!\",\"modified\":\"2024-02-18T07:38:52Z\"},\"review\":\"I love the simple design and color scheme. It works very well for me as a habit tracker.\\n\\nI have two gripes at the moment. The first is this: I wish you could tap on the check-mark in the home screen widget at it would just mark the habit as complete, instead of opening up the app for you to mark it yourself. I don’t know if this is an iPhone limitation, or user error, or what, but it would be nice\\n\\nThe second is that it costs money. I think it’s a reasonable enough price to pay, but it’s a little shady that you market the app as free, when the features that make it useful are locked behind a paywall. Just sell the app for that amount on the App Store. Or better yet, let it be free. I don’t see what costs you are incurring providing this excellent service to your fellow men.\\n\\nThat being said, I paid for it, and so far it has been worth the cost.\",\"rating\":4,\"isEdited\":false,\"title\":\"An excellent habit tracker\",\"userName\":\"TheGoldHA\"}},{\"id\":\"9466333479\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2023-01-03T13:11:03Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"id\":34109438,\"body\":\"Thank you so much for your kind words. Lots of improvements and new features will come to HabitKit in the future!\",\"modified\":\"2023-01-05T11:57:29Z\"},\"review\":\"I’ve been looking for a solution to help keep track of my workouts, reading, and alcohol consumption. Specifically, I wanted a solution that would let me visualize my progress in those areas. HabitKit nails the visualization for me. \\n\\nThe maker of HabitKit is also quick to respond to questions and suggestions, which is a great sign of what’s to come with this solution.\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"title\":\"Simple and visually effective\",\"userName\":\"eric.peters\"}},{\"id\":\"10882654265\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2024-01-30T23:51:08Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"id\":42020576,\"body\":\"Thanks a lot for the awesome review!\",\"modified\":\"2024-02-18T07:40:13Z\"},\"review\":\"I love this app; it’s so clean and simple! The free version has up to four habits you can track, which I think is just the right amount for me personally, but for the quality of the app it’s definitely worth purchasing different plans based on your needs.\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"title\":\"Clean design and great interface\",\"userName\":\"KrisJDee\"}},{\"id\":\"10621175723\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2023-11-24T21:00:58Z\",\"review\":\"App is a nice very simple and friction free way to track habits.\\n\\nI hope it stays simple and friction free, however optionally being able to go in to a days task and put notes about goals to review later would be nice, especially for habits that you complete but vary in completion, like caloric intake or an amount of time spent doing a task. Maybe this is already in premium and i don’t know, but it isn’t advertised.\",\"rating\":4,\"isEdited\":false,\"title\":\"I like it\",\"userName\":\"Imagrownassman\"}}]},\"top-in-apps\":{\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/6443918070/top-in-apps?l=en-US\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"6444183590\",\"type\":\"in-apps\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/in-apps/6444183590?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=A\u0026price=990\u0026salableAdamId=6444183590\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\u0026offerName=habitkit_0099_1m\u0026appAdamId=6443918070\",\"type\":\"buy\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.99\",\"price\":0.99,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[],\"recurringSubscriptionPeriod\":\"P1M\"}],\"subscriptionFamilyName\":\"HabitKit Pro\",\"subscriptionFamilyRank\":1,\"offerName\":\"habitkit_0099_1m\",\"releaseDate\":\"2009-06-17\",\"isMerchandisedEnabled\":false,\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Unlimited access to all features\"},\"subscriptionFamilyId\":\"21044815\",\"icuLocale\":\"en_US@currency=USD\",\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/habitkit-pro-1-month/id6443918070\",\"isSubscription\":true,\"isMerchandisedVisibleByDefault\":false,\"isFamilyShareable\":false,\"name\":\"HabitKit Pro (1 Month)\"}},{\"id\":\"6444258879\",\"type\":\"in-apps\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/in-apps/6444258879?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=A\u0026price=14990\u0026salableAdamId=6444258879\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\u0026offerName=habitkit_1799_lt\u0026appAdamId=6443918070\",\"type\":\"buy\",\"pric