kouts.\\n\\nSTAY ORGANIZED\\nKeep up with your routines by organizing your workouts and exercises in beautiful lists. Be in control of your data and manage it how you like. See the details of your workouts and explore relevant session data.\\n\\nGAIN INSIGHTS\\nExtract valuable insights out of your data. See your progress in specific exercises or muscle groups and decide when it is time to up the numbers. Liftbear will show your data in beautiful visualizations and charts.\\n\\nSTART TRACKING\\nTrack every workout, exercise, set, repetition, weight and time while you are working out. Liftbear tells you when your rest time is over, and it’s time to continue with the next set. Filter your data by week, month or year. See your full training history and have your data right at your hand. \\n\\nFEATURES\\n\\nStay Organized\\n- Create and organize your exercises by type and muscle groups\\n- Build your workouts and manage them in beautiful lists\\n- Add exercises and sets to workouts\\n- Adjust sets based on weights, repetitions and time\\n- Reorder exercises and sets\\n\\nGain Insights\\n- Filter training data by week, month and year\\n- Beautiful data visualizations of your exercise progress\\n- Muscle group distribution charts\\n- Consistency graph\\n\\nStart Tracking\\n- Log workouts, exercises, sets, repetitions and weight while working out\\n- Explore full training history\\n- Adjustable rest timer\\n- Choose from over 50 predefined exercises\\n\\nTerms of Use: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.liftbear.app/privacy/\"},\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"requiredCapabilitiesForRealityDevice\":\"arm64 \",\"versionHistory\":[{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.7.3\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This release includes several bugfixes and performance optimizations.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-01-04\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-01-04T11:13:59Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.7.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This release includes various bugfixes and UI optimizations.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-11-01\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-11-01T09:50:58Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.7.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This release includes UI optimizations for large screens.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-10-25\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-10-25T07:49:01Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.7.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This release includes the following new features:\\n- Track your body metrics like weight, bodyfat percentage or biceps size\\n- Share your completed sessions or new personal bests on social media\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-09-12\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-09-12T05:04:51Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.6.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This release contains several performance optimizations and UI improvements.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-08-21\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-08-21T11:14:17Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.6.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This release includes several bugfixes, performance optimizations and UI improvements.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-08-17\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-08-17T10:00:24Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.6.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This release includes several new and exciting features:\\n- Secondary muscle groups for exercises\\n- Notes in workouts and sessions\\n- New exercise type: Assisted Weight\\n- New workout icons\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-08-12\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-08-12T04:24:17Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.5.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This update contains several bugfixes and performance optimizations.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-07-29\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-07-29T06:06:54Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.5.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This update contains the following updates:\\n- 1RM calculation\\n- Alternative exercises\\n- New action menu design\\n- Session ratings\\n- Exercise timer countdown\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-07-27\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-07-27T07:47:24Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.4.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"We are working hard to make Liftbear better with every version. This update contains several bugfixes and performance enhancements. It is now possible to \\\"Sign in with Google\\\".\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-07-22\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-07-22T07:52:51Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.4.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"We are working hard to make Liftbear better with every version. This update contains several bugfixes and performance enhancements.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-06-30\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-06-30T19:36:57Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.4.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"We are working hard to make Liftbear better with every version. This update includes the following changes:\\n\\n- Supersets: Combine multiple exercises to supersets in workouts and sessions\\n- Warm-up Sets: Mark a set as warm-up set, which won't be accounted in your statistics\\n- Weekly Session Goals: Add your weekly goal and see your progress\\n- Weekday Distribution Graph: Explore which days are youre favourite training days\\n- Records: Find out on which days you made new records in which exercise\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-06-29\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-06-29T13:28:46Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.3.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This version includes several bugfixes.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-06-09\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-06-09T09:51:49Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.3.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This version includes several bugfixes.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-06-01\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-06-01T18:54:36Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.3.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This update includes the following changes:\\n\\n- Timebased exercises\\n- Filter exercises by muscle group\\n- Over 50 predefined exercises to choose from\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-06-01\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-06-01T05:54:06Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.2.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This update includes the following changes:\\n\\n- 7 day trial for Liftbear Pro\\n- Theme picker\\n- Consistency graph\\n- Progress charts overhaul\\n- Pin workouts and exercises\\n- Search workouts and exercises\",\"re