ware Applications\",\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/developer/cosmic-taps-sl/id997825935\"}}]},\"genres\":{\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/1403517519/genres?l=en-US\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"6007\",\"type\":\"genres\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/genres/6007?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"parentName\":\"App Store\",\"name\":\"Productivity\",\"url\":\"https://itunes.apple.com/us/genre/id6007\",\"parentId\":\"36\"}},{\"id\":\"6012\",\"type\":\"genres\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/genres/6012?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"parentName\":\"App Store\",\"name\":\"Lifestyle\",\"parentId\":\"36\",\"url\":\"https://itunes.apple.com/us/genre/id6012\"}}]}},\"meta\":{\"contentVersion\":{\"RTCI\":1708879097383,\"MZ_INDEXER\":1707809307034}}},{\"id\":\"1514915737\",\"type\":\"apps\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/1514915737?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"distributionKind\":\"APP_STORE\",\"supportsArcade\":false,\"isFirstPartyHideableApp\":false,\"privacy\":{\"privacyTypes\":[{\"privacyType\":\"Data Not Linked to You\",\"identifier\":\"DATA_NOT_LINKED_TO_YOU\",\"description\":\"The following data may be collected but it is not linked to your identity:\",\"dataCategories\":[{\"dataCategory\":\"Purchases\",\"identifier\":\"PURCHASES\"}]}]},\"contentRatingsBySystem\":{\"appsApple\":{\"name\":\"12+\",\"value\":300,\"rank\":3,\"advisories\":[\"Infrequent/Mild Alcohol, Tobacco, or Drug Use or References\"]}},\"deviceFamilies\":[\"mac\",\"watch\",\"iphone\",\"ipad\",\"ipod\"],\"supportsStreamlinedBuy\":false,\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/awesome-habits-habit-tracker/id1514915737\",\"userRating\":{\"value\":4.8,\"ratingCount\":341,\"ratingCountList\":[4,6,7,28,296],\"ariaLabelForRatings\":\"4.8 stars\"},\"firstVersionSupportingInAppPurchaseApi\":\"1.0.1\",\"watchBundleId\":\"com.dreamer.Habits.watchkitapp\",\"genreDisplayName\":\"Productivity\",\"name\":\"Awesome Habits: Habit Tracker\",\"isPreorder\":false,\"isIOSBinaryMacOSCompatible\":false,\"artistName\":\"Michal Tuma\",\"reviewsRestricted\":false,\"requirementsByDeviceFamily\":{\"ipad\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPad\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iPadOS 15.2 or later.\"},\"ipod\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPod touch\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 15.2 or later.\"},\"mac\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"Mac\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires macOS 12.1 or later.\"},\"iphone\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPhone\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 15.2 or later.\"},\"watch\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"Apple Watch\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires watchOS 8.0 or later.\"},\"realityDevice\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"Apple Vision\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires visionOS 1.0 or later.\"}},\"minimumWatchOSVersion\":\"8.0\",\"platformAttributes\":{\"osx\":{\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Don't set goals, build habits.\\n\\nDo you remember the last time you wanted to achieve something? You may have started strong, but after some time, maybe you lost motivation. Here is our tip – instead of setting goals, start building your daily routines, and improving your regular habits. Small and easy changes will compound into remarkable results. With our app, you will get better every day and achieve the kind of success that lasts.\\n\\nBuild good habits, break bad ones.\\nWant to cut down on alcohol, improve your healthy habits, or be more productive? Possibilities are unlimited. Get inspiration from our pre-defined templates or add your custom habit.\\n\\nAchieve your daily, weekly, and monthly goals.\\nUsing a simple overview, you can easily manage all your goals and see your achievements. Have you overachieved your goal? You can track that too.\\n\\nTrack your progress.\\nBrowse history, check out your stats and see how you've improved over time.\\nDidn't have time to track a previous day? No problem, you can easily update any record in the past.\\n\\nFeatures:\\n- Build good habits, break bad ones\\n- Daily, weekly, and monthly goals\\n- Track even overachieved goals\\n- Track time-based goals with timers\\n- History and statistics\\n- Habit lists\\n- Habit notes\\n- 2,500+ icons \u0026 emojis\\n- Apple Health support (available on iOS)\\n- Reminders, app badge, and Apple Health notifications\\n- Interactive widgets for Home Screen, Lock Screen, and StandBy mode\\n- Interactive Dynamic Island \u0026 Live Activities\\n- Apple Watch complications and the Smart Stack widget\\n- Works on iPhone, iPad, Mac, and Apple Watch\\n- iCloud backup \u0026 sync\\n- Export to a CSV file\\n- Siri Shortcuts\\n- Dark Mode support and appearance customization\\n\\nTerms of Use: https://www.awesome-habits.com/terms-conditions\\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.awesome-habits.com/privacy-policy\"},\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"requiredCapabilitiesForRealityDevice\":\"arm64 \",\"versionHistory\":[{\"versionDisplay\":\"5.2.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-02-05\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-02-05T09:31:58Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"5.2.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-02-01\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-02-01T00:53:31Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"5.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Happy Holidays!\\n\\n• Vacation mode: Need a break before new year’s challenges? Try our new Vacation mode. It lets you pause your habits while keeping your streaks intact.\\n• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-12-25\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-12-25T14:31:01Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"5.1.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-11-13\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-11-13T21:01:47Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"5.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Add custom progress: For habits with larger goals, you can now quickly add a custom progress value directly from the habit card.\\n• Last change date: Not sure when you last updated your progress? Drag a habit card up to check the date of your last change.\\n• New Apple Health metrics: Track the time you spend in daylight to improve your physical and mental well-being (requires an Apple Watch with watchOS 10). Also, you can now track Flexibility and Mind \u0026 body workouts.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-10-25\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-10-25T18:57:04Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"5.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Interactive widgets: Update your progress with a single tap, directly from the widgets. Available with iOS 17 and macOS Sonoma.\\n• Interactive Dynamic Island \u0026 Live Activities: Pause or stop habit timers directly from the Dynamic Island or from the iPhone and iPad Lock Screen. Available with iOS 17.\\n• New places for widgets: Add widgets in StandBy mode, to iPad Lock Screen, and Smart Stack on Apple Watch. Available with iOS 17 and watchOS 10.\\n• Improved shortcuts: You can now run multi-step shortcuts without opening the app. Simply turn off “Open When Run” option in Shortcuts app editor.\\n\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-09-22\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-09-22T05:44:06Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.8\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Interactive charts: Swipe through the charts to browse your history. Hover over to view details.\\n• Weekly averages: Switch to the weekly tab in the charts to compare your results on a weekly basis.\\n• New emojis: Personalize your habits with the latest emojis. \\n• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-07-10\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-07-10T12:07:59Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.7.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-05-16\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-05-16T15:19:39Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.7.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-05-01\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-05-01T08:43:25Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.7\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Group skipped and completed: Now you can easily group skipped or completed habits. Turn this option on in Settings \u003e General \u003e Sorting \u0026 Grouping.\\n• Custom repeat: Set custom repeats for your habits. E.g. exercise every 3 days.\\n• New Apple Health metrics: Track your Stand minutes and Traditional strength training.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-04-22\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-04-22T08:23:06Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.6\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Data export: Now you can easily export your data to a CSV file and dive deeper into your results.\\n• New emojis: Personalize your habits with the latest emojis.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-02-10\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-02-10T06:59:05Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.5\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Be awesome in 2023!\\n• New Apple Health categories: Track your workouts, stand hours, toothbrushing, and more. Available on your iPhone and Apple Watch.\\n• Live Activities: Start a habit timer and leave it open to see the elapsed time on your Lock Screen. Available on your iPhone with iOS 16.1 and later.\\n• New Siri Shortcuts: Change the goal, add custom progress, or get a habit status. Available in the Shortcuts app.\\n• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-01-04\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-01-04T15:55:34Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.4.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-11-07\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-11-07T16:07:36Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.4.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-11-02\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-11-02T14:11:54Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.4\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Background timers: Track your time-based habits in the background. Get up-to-date progress on all your devices.\\n• App badge: See the number of incomplete habits right on the app icon.\\n• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-10-30\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-10-30T10:08:27Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.3.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-09-28\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-09-28T21:50:54Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.3.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Relevant notifications: We now automatically clear all notifications that are no longer relevant, e.g., when you complete a habit.\\n• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-09-20\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-09-20T12:14:53Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.3\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Emojis and 400+ new icons: Find the best icon for your habit in the extended icon library – now with emojis and improved search.\\n• New notification actions: Start a timer or complete one iteration of a habit right from a notification.\\n• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-08-11\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-08-11T06:53:51Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.2.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-06-09\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-06-09T08:43:25Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.2.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-05-28\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-05-28T10:02:24Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Add a description: Now you can add a description to your habits. Click Show more on the Edit habit screen to see this option.\\n• Add a website or Siri shortcut URL: Use Siri shortcuts, e.g., to launch your favorite meditation app, play an audiobook, start a workout, or whatever you need to complete your goal. Click Show more on the Edit habit screen to see this option. (Siri Shortcuts are available in macOS Monterey or later.)\\n• Customize Apple Health units: Choose the distance and volume units you prefer in Settings \u003e General \u003e Apple Health units.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-05-27\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-05-27T19:53:39Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.1.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-04-17\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-04-17T13:21:39Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Stay motivated with streaks: You can now see your current streaks right on the Home tab and widgets. Go to Settings \u003e General \u003e and turn on Show streaks.\\n• For night owls: Widgets and stats will not reset until 4 AM or until you start modifying the next day. Now you have plenty of time to review your day and enjoy the progress before you go to bed.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-04-17\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-04-17T08:27:57Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.0.5\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-02-26\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-02-26T23:13:09Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.0.4\",\"releaseNotes\":\"• Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-01-15\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-01-15T04:48:59Z\"}],\"websiteUrl\":\"https://www.awesome-habits.com\",\"minimumXROSVersion\":\"1.0\",\"isXROSCompatible\":true,\"messagesScreenshots\":{},\"hasSafariExtension\":false,\"requiresGameController\":false,\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1514915737\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=863381777\",\"type\":\"get\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.00\",\"price\":0,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"macSoftware\",\"size\":7888370}]},{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1514915737\u0026pricingParameters=SWUPD\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=863381777\",\"type\":\"update\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.00\",\"price\":0,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"macSoftware\",\"size\":7888370}]}],\"requires32bit\":false,\"releaseDate\":\"2020-06-23\",\"hasInAppPurchases\":true,\"bundleId\":\"com.dreamer.Habits\",\"hasMessagesExtension\":false,\"artwork\":{\"width\":1024,\"height\":1024,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple126/v4/f4/38/1f/f4381f11-69af-63dc-d269-b53a7ecbcdd3/AppIcon-0-0-2x_U007euniversal-0-4-0-85-220.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"000000\",\"textColor1\":\"ffffff\",\"textColor2\":\"a665ee\",\"textColor3\":\"cbcbcb\",\"tex