":\"Data Not Linked to You\",\"identifier\":\"DATA_NOT_LINKED_TO_YOU\",\"description\":\"The following data may be collected but it is not linked to your identity:\",\"dataCategories\":[{\"dataCategory\":\"Diagnostics\",\"identifier\":\"DIAGNOSTICS\"}]}]},\"contentRatingsBySystem\":{\"appsApple\":{\"name\":\"4+\",\"value\":100,\"rank\":1}},\"deviceFamilies\":[\"mac\",\"iphone\"],\"supportsStreamlinedBuy\":false,\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/jomo-screen-time-blocker/id1609960918\",\"userRating\":{\"value\":4.8,\"ratingCount\":269,\"ratingCountList\":[8,2,3,10,246],\"ariaLabelForRatings\":\"4.8 stars\"},\"firstVersionSupportingInAppPurchaseApi\":\"1.0.0\",\"genreDisplayName\":\"Productivity\",\"name\":\"Jomo - Screen Time Blocker\",\"isPreorder\":false,\"isIOSBinaryMacOSCompatible\":false,\"artistName\":\"Jomo\",\"reviewsRestricted\":false,\"requirementsByDeviceFamily\":{\"mac\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"Mac\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires macOS 13.0 or later.\"},\"iphone\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPhone\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 16.0 or later.\"},\"realityDevice\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"Apple Vision\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires visionOS 1.0 or later.\"}},\"platformAttributes\":{\"osx\":{\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Struggling with distractions on your Mac? With so many websites and apps providing endless entertainment just a click away, it can be challenging to stay on track.\\n\\nJomo helps you keep your focus and screen time in check day after day. It allows you to block distracting apps and websites in just a few clicks and to use them on a timer, helping you focus better and make the most out of your days.\\n\\nSo, are you ready for a better screen time and focus? Download Jomo and let's get started!\\n\\n\\n** TOP 15 APPS CREATED BY WOMEN 2023 - APPLE APP STORE **\\n\\n\\n◆ BENEFITS ◆\\n\\n- Increased Focus: Work better by reducing distractions and multitasking. Experience an instant improvement in your productivity and the quality of your work.\\n- Digital Minimalism: Align your Mac usage with your intentions. Set up long-term procedures that will help you block impulse opens and encourage a more balanced use of your Mac.\\n- Better Sleep: End mindless scrolling and binge-watching at bedtime. Get enough sleep and wake up feeling refreshed.\\n- Healthy Habits: Organize your days and align your actions with your goals. Say good-bye to procrastination.\\n- Save Money: Avoid impulsive purchases and excessive exposure to social media ads.\\n- Break Addictions: Block websites related to porn, gambling, and more.\\n\\n◆ FEATURES ◆\\n\\n- Website Blocker: Block any website on the following browsers: Safari, Google Chrome, Arc, Opera, Microsoft Edge, and Brave Browser.\\n- App Blocker: Block any app on your Mac (e.g., Mail, Slack).\\n- Breaks: Take short, intentional breaks from blocking. Prevent mindless scrolling by using distracting websites and apps on a timer.\\n- Schedules: Schedule recurring blocking sessions, such as Monday to Friday during your work hours.\\n- Easy to set up: Start blocking apps and websites in just a few clicks. Using our templates, you can easily build a focus system that meets your specific needs.\\n- Secure: Jomo blocks apps and websites requiring minimal permissions. It is safe, precise, and doesn't slow down your Mac.\\n\\n◆ JOMO PLUS ◆\\n\\n**SAVE 2+ HOURS EVERY DAY AND REGAIN YOUR ABILITY TO FOCUS FOR THE PRICE OF A COFFEE**\\n\\nIncluded in Jomo Plus:\\n- Unlimited Recurring Sessions: Add multiple recurring sessions.\\n- Strict Mode:  You can configure Jomo for Mac to be much harder to bypass.\\n- The subscription also includes the iPhone and iPad version!\\n\\nJomo offers auto-renewable subscriptions:\\n\\n- $5.99/month (automatically renewed)\\n- $2.49/month (billed annually via a $29.99 payment)\\n- $99.99 (one-time purchase)\\n\\nThe yearly plan includes a 3-day free trial.\\n\\nAfter the free trial (only available on the annual version), the total amount for the subscription will be charged to your iTunes Account. The subscription automatically renews unless it is canceled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. Your account will be charged for renewal at the total subscription price within 24 hours prior to the end of the current period. Subscriptions and auto-renewals may be managed or canceled via your iTunes Account Settings.\\n\\nThese prices are in US Dollars (USD). Pricing in other currencies and countries may vary and actual charges may be converted to your local currency depending on the country of residence.\\n\\n◆ PRIVACY ◆\\n\\nIf you want to learn more about our terms and privacy policy:\\n\\n- Terms of Use: https://getjomo.notion.site/Terms-of-Use-fb74fe39233b468f937707aeb2020bc2\\n- Privacy Policy: https://getjomo.notion.site/Privacy-Policy-7265a825c9fe4b289229cec614a169fd\"},\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"requiredCapabilitiesForRealityDevice\":\"arm64 \",\"websiteUrl\":\"https://jomo.so/\",\"versionHistory\":[{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New in this version:\\n\\n◆ SESSION TEMPLATES AND APP GROUPS ◆\\n\\nIn this new version, we've added not one, but two of your most requested features for Jomo Mac:\\n* You can now create and edit session templates on Jomo Mac. This allows you to fine-tune sessions to your liking and reuse them anytime, saving you a lot of time!\\n* Finally, we've added app groups to Jomo Mac. With app groups, you can define reusable lists of apps and websites to block. These lists can then be easily reused in your blocking sessions, allowing you to create groups for fun apps, work apps, etc.\\n\\n◆ IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* We have added support for Orion.\u2028\\n* We have improved the “All except…” mode for apps, ensuring it doesn’t block any important system apps (thanks to Andy for the feedback).\\n\\nEnjoying Jomo Mac? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you like about it :)\\n\\nTake care,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-02-07\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-02-07T09:16:18Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New in this version:\\n\\n◆ JOMO MAC NOW SUPPORTS WHITELISTS AND ADULT CONTENT ◆\\n\\nYou can now use Jomo on Mac to block all apps and websites except those you specify. Additionally, you can block categories of websites, starting with adult content. These were among the top requested features since we released the first version of Jomo for Mac. We hope you will appreciate this update.\\n\\n◆ IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* We have added support for the Vivaldi browser (thanks to Gianni and Mohamed for your feedback).\\n* We have added a way to define exceptions to your website's blocklist. For example, you can block “youtube.com” but define an exception for “music.youtube.com” (thanks to Hyunni for the suggestion).\\n* We have fixed a bug which caused the profile not to sync automatically (thanks to Jaga for reporting it).\\n* We have made a range of optimizations to ensure Jomo runs smoothly on your Mac.\\n* We have fixed an issue that prevented users from updating the app when a blocking rule was active.\\n* We have fixed a bug where multiple sessions with whitelists were not merging correctly (special thanks to Rayan for reporting this).\u2028\\n\\nEnjoying Jomo Mac? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you like about it :)\\n\\nTake care,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-01-23\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-01-23T08:29:24Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.0\",\"releaseNotes\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2023-12-15\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-12-15T08:33:34Z\"}],\"minimumXROSVersion\":\"1.0\",\"isXROSCompatible\":true,\"messagesScreenshots\":{},\"hasSafariExtension\":false,\"requiresGameController\":false,\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1609960918\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=863451391\",\"type\":\"get\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.00\",\"price\":0,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"macSoftware\",\"size\":15665834}]},{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1609960918\u0026pricingParameters=SWUPD\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=863451391\",\"type\":\"update\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.00\",\"price\":0,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"macSoftware\",\"size\":15665834}]}],\"requires32bit\":false,\"releaseDate\":\"2022-10-16\",\"hasInAppPurchases\":true,\"bundleId\":\"com.jomo.Jomo\",\"hasMessagesExtension\":false,\"artwork\":{\"width\":1024,\"height\":1024,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple126/v4/4f/cf/cc/4fcfcc2c-8bc2-b63b-3677-0e1ea3a4df51/AppIcon-0-0-85-220-0-0-4-0-2x.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"000000\",\"textColor1\":\"99b0ff\",\"textColor2\":\"839efe\",\"textColor3\":\"7a8ccb\",\"textColor4\":\"697ecb\"},\"videoPreviewsByType\":{},\"privacyPolicyUrl\":\"https://getjomo.notion.site/Privacy-Policy-7265a825c9fe4b289229cec614a169fd\",\"supportURLForLanguage\":\"https://help.jomo.so/en/\",\"isStandaloneForWatchOS\":false,\"isHiddenFromSpringboard\":false,\"isDeliveredInIOSAppForWatchOS\":false,\"runsOnAppleSilicon\":true,\"requiresRosetta\":false,\"editorialArtwork\":{\"contentIconTrimmedMonochrome\":{\"width\":1048,\"height\":1080,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features116/v4/6e/e2/e7/6ee2e7db-bf98-0d30-7adf-15aa80debeb5/721e011e-109f-4227-8978-1f8c6071c48f.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"000000\",\"textColor1\":\"f2f2f2\",\"textColor2\":\"e5e5e5\",\"textColor3\":\"c1c1c1\",\"textColor4\":\"b7b7b7\"},\"contentIconTrimmed\":{\"width\":1048,\"height\":1080,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features126/v4/09/15/89/091589bc-f33b-2d71-9e77-2ef3729cd955/abc2adb6-5a59-47b0-b8f5-84523bdd6bd8.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"0092ff\",\"textColor1\":\"00070c\",\"textColor2\":\"000e19\",\"textColor3\":\"00233d\",\"textColor4\":\"002947\"},\"brandLogo\":{\"width\":1080,\"height\":1080,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features116/v4/1c/2b/7c/1c2b7cc6-e029-9bf9-f26f-4b5f533ee2fc/af8e3a5e-dba7-4ad7-9b94-9340366eab93.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"000000\",\"textColor1\":\"efefef\",\"textColor2\":\"dfdfdf\",\"textColor3\":\"b5b5b5\",\"textColor4\":\"a9a9a9\"}},\"subtitle\":\"Self Control \u0026 Focus\",\"preflightPackageUrl\":\"https://osxapps.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/Purple126/v4/85/d6/60/85d66089-93c7-a69e-efe1-2e2409dc36ff/vni12264834075493069450.pfpkg\",\"runsOnIntel\":true,\"customAttributes\":{\"default\":{\"default\":{\"customVideoPreviewsByType\":{},\"customScreenshotsByType\":{\"mac\":[{\"width\":2880,\"height\":1800,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource116/v4/aa/44/c8/aa44c852-819b-ff7b-d5c0-1fa1d1c644b6/12aa3277-aad2-4410-ad6f-716c81e29b17_1_EN.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"7490f7\",\"textColor1\":\"000000\",\"textColor2\":\"1f1824\",\"textColor3\":\"171c31\",\"textColor4\":\"30304e\"},{\"width\":2880,\"height\":1800,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource116/v4/82/88/d8/8288d892-590d-e71b-9ecf-10a74d3822ac/1db6b16a-cfc9-4f62-8217-05fe3352cac4_2_EN.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"7490f7\",\"textColor1\":\"000000\",\"textColor2\":\"22183a\",\"textColor3\":\"171c31\",\"textColor4\":\"323060\"},{\"width\":2880,\"height\":1800,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource116/v4/53/67/8d/53678d69-5650-9c97-7f1b-0836895cf7b5/e729e6c6-7054-433a-9d7c-9522af3e3105_3_EN.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"7490f7\",\"textColor1\":\"000000\",\"textColor2\":\"101111\",\"textColor3\":\"171c31\",\"textColor4\":\"242a3f\"},{\"width\":2880,\"height\":1800,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource126/v4/0b/b6/00/0bb600ab-2a8a-c71e-35f9-f66c82e73912/0b92e025-366e-4a22-965b-292f2493de53_4_EN.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"7490f7\",\"textColor1\":\"000000\",\"textColor2\":\"161616\",\"textColor3\":\"171c31\",\"textColor4\":\"292f43\"},{\"width\":2880,\"height\":1800,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource116/v4/db/3e/f2/db3ef288-32dc-c206-c2aa-ca66bc37e86b/e8acd027-a915-423f-a4d0-74e21a804b50_5_EN.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"7490f7\",\"textColor1\":\"000209\",\"textColor2\":\"1b1c22\",\"textColor3\":\"171e38\",\"textColor4\":\"2d334d\"}]}}}}},\"ios\":{\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Welcome to Jomo, an app that helps you stop wasting time on your phone so you can thrive every day!\\n\\nWe make reducing screen time super easy and fun.\\n\\nUnsure of how to improve your screen time? We got you! Jomo will help you understand the time spent on your phone and how to find a healthy balance between productivity and play. Will you be #productive or #distracted? Come and find out!\\n\\nJomo offers a powerful app-blocking system that will change how you use your phone in the long term. Block one or more apps for the times you set to focus on what matters most. You can always take mindful breaks if you need to.\\n\\nSo, ready to feel proud about your screen time? Download Jomo and let's get started!\\n\\n◆ BENEFITS ◆\\n\\n1. Sleep Better: Stop mindless scrolling at bedtime\\n2. Stay Focused: Work better by reducing distractions and multitasking\\n3. Save Time: Reduce your screen time by 50% in the first week\\n4. Healthy Habits: Protect special moments with your screen time routine\\n5. Save Money: Prevent impulsive buying and being overexposed to social media ads\\n6. Break Addictions: Block adult content, gambling websites, and more\\n\\n◆ PRIVACY ◆\\n\\nTo access your screen time and block apps, Jomo uses the secured Screen Time API provided by Apple. Jomo has no access and will never see your private data (used apps, passwords, messages, content viewed, etc.).\\n\\nIf you want to learn more about our terms and privacy policy:\\n\\n- Terms of Use: https://getjomo.notion.site/Terms-of-Use-fb74fe39233b468f937707aeb2020bc2\\n- Privacy Policy: https://getjomo.notion.site/Privacy-Policy-7265a825c9fe4b289229cec614a169fd\\n\\n◆ JOMO PLUS ◆\\n\\nJomo offers auto-renewable subscriptions:\\n\\n- $5.99/month (automatically renewed)\\n- $2.49/month (billed annually via a $29.99 payment)\\n- $99.99 (one-time purchase)\\n\\nThe yearly plan includes a 3-day free trial.\\n\\nAfter the free trial (only available on the annual version), the total amount for the subscription will be charged to your iTunes Account. The subscription automatically renews unless it is canceled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. Your account will be charged for renewal at the total subscription price within 24 hours prior to the end of the current period. Subscriptions and auto-renewals may be managed or canceled via your iTunes Account Settings.\\n\\nThese prices are in US Dollars (USD). Pricing in other currencies and countries may vary and actual charges may be converted to your local currency depending on the country of residence.\"},\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"requiredCapabilitiesForRealityDevice\":\"arm64 \",\"versionHistory\":[{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.8.6\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New in this version:\\n\\n◆ SAVE TIME WITH APP GROUPS ◆\\n\\nIn this new version, we've added one of your most-requested features: APP GROUPS.\\n\\nWith App Groups, you can create reusable lists of apps and websites to block. You can easily use these groups in your sessions. When configuring a session, navigate to “Blocked Content” and then select “Link App Group”. The coolest part is that any changes made to a group, such as adding an app, will be updated in all sessions using that group!\\n\\nYou can create different groups for various needs, such as fun apps, work apps, or a detox mode that blocks almost everything.\\n\\nCurrently, app groups are only available for sessions.\\n\\n◆ IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* We have revamped our blocked content selection screen to improve legibility and reduce errors.\\n* We have added quick access to the “Healthy Alternatives” screen in the “Rules” tab.\\n* We have fixed a bug where multiple sessions with whitelists were not merging correctly (special thanks to Rayan for reporting this).\\n* We have introduced a new “Is Session Active? (By Name)” shortcut, which allows you to check the status of a session by its name, rather than by an identifier. This is useful if the session whose status you want to know is not necessarily scheduled.\u2028\\n* We have fixed an issue where the timer stayed stuck on the start break screen after going to the background.\\n* Two new shortcuts were added: \\\"RedirectIfSessionBlocking\\\" and \\\"RedirectIfConditionBlocking\\\". Thanks to these new shortcuts, you can block any app using Apple's Shortcuts app and synchronize the blocking status with a specific session or condition.\\n* We have improved troubleshooting in various scenarios (login, app picker issues, etc.).\\n\\nEnjoying Jomo? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you like about it :)\\n\\nTake care,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-02-04\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-02-04T15:09:10Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.8.5\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New in this version:\\n\\n◆ SAVE TIME WITH APP GROUPS ◆\\n\\nIn this new version, we've added one of your most-requested features: APP GROUPS.\\n\\nWith App Groups, you can create reusable lists of apps and websites to block. You can easily use these groups in your sessions. When configuring a session, navigate to “Blocked Content” and then select “Link App Group”. The coolest part is that any changes made to a group, such as adding an app, will be updated in all sessions using that group!\\n\\nYou can create different groups for various needs, such as fun apps, work apps, or a detox mode that blocks almost everything.\\n\\nCurrently, app groups are only available for sessions.\\n\\n◆ IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* We have revamped our blocked content selection screen to improve legibility and reduce errors.\\n* We have added quick access to the “Healthy Alternatives” screen in the “Rules” tab.\\n* We have fixed a bug where multiple sessions with whitelists were not merging correctly (special thanks to Rayan for reporting this).\\n* We have introduced a new “Is Session Active? (By Name)” shortcut, which allows you to check the status of a session by its name, rather than by an identifier. This is useful if the session whose status you want to know is not necessarily scheduled.\u2028\\n\\nEnjoying Jomo? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you like about it :)\\n\\nTake care,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-01-23\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-01-23T09:49:25Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.8.4\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New in this version:\\n\\n◆ START 2024 ON THE RIGHT FOOT WITH EXPERT TIPS ◆\\n\\nIn this first release of the year, we've introduced a new category of healthy alternatives: Expert Tips! Now, you can access inspiring quotes from leading productivity and screen time experts every time you open a blocked app.\\n\\nWe've incorporated insights from James Clear (\\\"Atomic Habits\\\"), Nir Eyal (\\\"Hooked,\\\" \\\"Indistractable\\\"), Cal Newport (\\\"Deep Work,\\\" \\\"Digital Minimalism\\\"), and many others. Additionally, you'll find advice from Clo S., a certified digital wellbeing coach at This Too Shall Grow. If you'd like us to include quotes from a specific book, or if you're involved in digital wellbeing or productivity and wish to be featured on our blog screens, please reach out at hello@jomo.so.\\n\\nWe have a lot of exciting things coming up in 2024 and we can’t wait to share more with you in the coming weeks. Let's continue to embrace the JOMO in 2024.\\n\\n**Happy New Year to all of you!**\\n\\n◆ IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* We have fixed an issue involving duplicate notifications with blocking sessions started using shortcuts.\\n* We have enhanced our mechanism for blocking apps while still receiving notifications (many thanks to Boaz for all the feedback).\\n* The app limits can no longer be edited or deleted within 5 minutes following a refresh, as indicated in the alert message that appears when refreshing a limit. Special thanks to Alyssa for bringing this bug to our attention.\\n\\nEnjoying Jomo? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you like about it :)\\n\\nTake care,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-01-04\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-01-04T13:51:27Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.8.3\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New in this version:\\n\\n◆ OUR CHRISTMAS GIFT FOR YOU: JOMO ON MAC ◆\\n\\nYour incredible support this year has been a true gift to us. That's why Santa Jomo is thrilled to announce some great news: Jomo is now available on Mac! You can download it right now from the Mac App Store. Additionally, if you are a Jomo Plus member, your plan will seamlessly extend to the Mac app.\\n\\nWe are on a mission to help you manage your screen time and maintain focus across all your devices. The launch of our Mac app marks a significant step towards this goal. We're excited for you to try it and eager to hear your feedback.\\n\\n**Merry Christmas to you all!**\\n\\n—\\n\\nHere’s what you can do on Jomo Mac:\\n* Website Blocker: Block any website on the following browsers: Safari, Google Chrome, Arc, Opera, Microsoft Edge, and Brave Browser.\\n* App Blocker: Block any app on your Mac (e.g., Mail, Slack).\\n* Breaks: Take short, intentional breaks from blocking. Prevent mindless scrolling by using distracting websites and apps on a timer.\\n* Schedules: Schedule recurring blocking sessions, such as Monday to Friday during your work hours.\\n* Easy to set up: Start blocking apps and websites in just a few clicks. Using our templates, you can easily build a focus system that meets your specific needs.\\n* Secure: Jomo blocks apps and websites requiring minimal permissions. It is safe, precise, and doesn't slow down your Mac.\\n\\n—\\n\\n◆ IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* We have fixed an issue with the \\\"Start Session\\\" shortcut that occurred with iOS 17.2.\\n* You will no longer receive notifications for sessions that are snoozed.\\n* We have improved the 'Pause Session' shortcut to ensure it considers all relevant break options you have configured.\\n* We have fixed a bug that previously made it impossible for some users to use Apple Sign-In.\\n* Special app icon for Christmas 2023.\\n\\nEnjoying Jomo? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you like about it :)\\n\\nTake care,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-12-20\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-12-20T13:43:38Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.8.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New in this version:\\n\\n◆ OUR CHRISTMAS GIFT FOR YOU: JOMO ON MAC ◆\\n\\nYour incredible support this year has been a true gift to us. That's why Santa Jomo is thrilled to announce some great news: Jomo is now available on Mac! You can download it right now from the Mac App Store. Additionally, if you are a Jomo Plus member, your plan will seamlessly extend to the Mac app.\\n\\nWe are on a mission to help you manage your screen time and maintain focus across all your devices. The launch of our Mac app marks a significant step towards this goal. We're excited for you to try it and eager to hear your feedback.\\n\\n**Merry Christmas to you all!**\\n\\n—\\n\\nHere’s what you can do on Jomo Mac:\\n* Website Blocker: Block any website on the following browsers: Safari, Google Chrome, Arc, Opera, Microsoft Edge, and Brave Browser.\\n* App Blocker: Block any app on your Mac (e.g., Mail, Slack).\\n* Breaks: Take short, intentional breaks from blocking. Prevent mindless scrolling by using distracting websites and apps on a timer.\\n* Schedules: Schedule recurring blocking sessions, such as Monday to Friday during your work hours.\\n* Easy to set up: Start blocking apps and websites in just a few clicks. Using our templates, you can easily build a focus system that meets your specific needs.\\n* Secure: Jomo blocks apps and websites requiring minimal permissions. It is safe, precise, and doesn't slow down your Mac.\\n\\n—\\n\\n◆ IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* You will no longer receive notifications for sessions that are snoozed.\\n* We have improved the 'Pause Session' shortcut to ensure it considers all relevant break options you have configured.\\n* We have fixed a bug that previously made it impossible for some users to use Apple Sign-In.\\n* Special app icon for Christmas 2023.\\n\\nEnjoying Jomo? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you like about it :)\\n\\nTake care,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-12-15\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-12-15T10:03:23Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.8.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New in this version:\\n\\n◆ JOMO CELEBRATES ITS 1-YEAR ANNIVERSARY WITH A BRAND-NEW IDENTITY ◆\\n\\nJomo was released a year ago! Since our launch in October 2022, we have built one of the most powerful and comprehensive screen time tools for iPhone/iPad. \\n\\nWith several thousand active users worldwide, a rating of 4.8/5 from over 350 reviews, and recognition as one of the top 15 apps created by women in 2023 according to Apple, we are proud of what we have achieved. We’d like to say a big thank you for your continued support and feedback. We couldn’t have done it without you.\\n\\nBut this is only the beginning. We are on a mission to build the best app to keep your screen time and focus in check, day after day, on all of your devices!\\n\\nStarting with a refreshed identity:\\n* A more minimalist interface that reflects our vision for Jomo: simple, efficient, and modern.\\n* An upgraded home screen experience: now you can easily switch between different metrics (screen time, pickups, notifications), and phone-free times are better highlighted on the daily graph.\\n* Refined widgets.\\n\\n◆ IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* Live activities will now automatically terminate when a compatible session ends.\\n\\nEnjoying Jomo? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you like about it :)\\n\\nTake care,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-11-01\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-11-01T08:19:31Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.7.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New in this version:\\n\\n◆ VACATION MODE FOR SESSIONS ◆\\n\\nGoing on holiday? Change of plans? You can now snooze your blocking sessions for the duration you wish instead of deleting them.\\n\\n• If your session is currently active, you can leave early by snoozing it until the end.\\n• Taking a vacation? Snooze your session until you choose to manually reactivate it. Additionally, you can set a reminder; Jomo will automatically notify you when it's time to turn your session back on!\\n\\nThis feature is only available for Jomo Plus users.\\n\\n◆ IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n• We’ve added clarifications and links to our help center in many areas of the app (squads, blocked content selection, etc.) to make your experience with Jomo smoother.\\n• We've fixed a bug that prevented some users from sending troubleshooting logs (Thanks to Nicolas for reporting the issue).\\n\\nEnjoying Jomo? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you like about it :)\\n\\nTake care,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-10-08\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-10-08T16:04:15Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.7.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New in this version:\\n\\n◆ NEW BLOCK SCREENS ◆\\n\\nIn this new version, healthy alternatives will be displayed on the screen that overlays the apps you've blocked with a Jomo session.\\n\\nBy default, Jomo will automatically suggest many alternatives (though you have the option to turn off these suggestions).\\n\\nAdditionally, you can still add your own alternatives, which will now be used to further customize your block screens! For instance, you can:\\n* Add a custom message, such as a reminder of an important personal deadline, which will appear each time you try to open a blocked app.\\n* Feature a contact on your block screen, along with a gentle reminder to check in with them.\\n* Suggest alternative \\\"positive\\\" apps that Jomo will recommend you open instead of the blocked ones.\\n\\nWe're thrilled about this enhancement and look forward to introducing even more alternatives in upcoming releases. Have a suggestion? We’d love to hear from you! Drop us a line at hello@jomo.so.\\n\\n◆ IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* We've resolved a crash that was preventing some users from accessing the app.\\n* We’ve refined the screen for taking a break from a session. Given the significant upgrades to our block screen experience, we’ve opted for a simpler, more straightforward version for this screen.\\n\\nEnjoying Jomo? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you like about it :)\\n\\nTake care,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-09-30\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-09-30T08:53:35Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.6.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New in this version:\\n\\n◆ UPDATES TO SQUADS ◆\\n\\nWe've introduced several enhancements to squads, making them even more enjoyable and engaging:\\n* The leaderboard now resets daily.\\n* We've added a scoreboard section that showcases the member who had the lowest screen time on a specific day over the past two weeks. Access the leaderboard for previous days by tapping on the desired day.\\n* A new trends section has been introduced.\\n* Avatars now synchronize and will display within squads.\\n\\n◆ BLOCK IN-APP PURCHASES ◆\\n\\nWith Jomo, you now have the option to block in-app purchases. When this feature is activated, purchases through the App Store or iTunes Store will be restricted while your rule is in effect. To activate, navigate to the blocked content screen \u003e Additional options \u003e Block in-app purchases.\\n\\n◆ IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* We've implemented numerous stability improvements.\\n* Resolved localization issues (special thanks to Sander and others for reporting).\\n\\nEnjoying Jomo? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you like about it :)\\n\\nTake care,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-09-24\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-09-24T08:26:17Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.6.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New in this version:\\n\\n◆ REDUCE SCREEN TIME TOGETHER WITH JOMO SQUADS ◆\\n\\nAs Jomo approaches its one-year anniversary, we are excited to introduce a brand-new feature: Jomo Squads. With Squads, you can invite your friends, family, or colleagues to share their screen time and work together to reduce it.\\n\\nThe goal is simple: achieve the lowest screen time in the group for the current week!\\n\\nWith the release of Squads, we are also pleased to announce our new family plans. These plans can be shared with up to five other family members. You can find them in our paywall screen by tapping on \\\"Family Plans\\\".\\n\\n◆ NEW WIDGETS + LIVE ACTIVITY ◆\\n\\nWe've revamped existing widgets and added three new ones:\\n* A \\\"Rules\\\" widget that summarizes all your screen time rules at a glance.\\n* A beautifully designed “Screen Time Chart” widget that displays an estimate of your screen time for the current week.\\n* An \\\"Offline Activities\\\" widget, created in collaboration with certified digital well-being coach Marguerite Pometko, founder of Digibloom. This widget suggests various replacement activities to help you stay away from your phone.\\n\\nLast but not least, your short, one-time sessions will now appear as Live Activity on your Lock Screen and Dynamic Island.\\n\\n◆ IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* We've updated the design for condition cards. You can now easily change the title of your condition. :)\\n* Sections on the profile screen have been reorganized.\\n* You can now see your daily pickups and notifications from the home screen.\\n* We've fixed app freezes that some of you were experiencing, and improved stability for app blocking.\\n* Jomo Shortcuts are now more easily discoverable through Spotlight.\\n* Interface customization options have been moved to the Settings screen.\\n* If you have set a maximum number of breaks for your session, that limit now applies to breaks taken during the ongoing session interval, not to the last 24 hours as it used to be. If the session is permanent, the limit applies to the current day. Thanks to Sophia and Eduardo for the feedback.\\n\\nEnjoying Jomo? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you like about it :)\\n\\nTake care,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-09-09\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-09-09T05:36:51Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.5.5\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New in this version:\\n\\nWe’ve made several changes to prepare Jomo for the next major iOS update (coming this fall). Read the next two sections carefully.\\n\\n◆ IF YOU'VE ADDED A FOCUS FILTER OR SHORTCUT ◆\\n\\nIf you've been using these, note that there might be issues right after updating to version 1.5.4. To fix this, just reopen your filter or shortcut and choose your session template again.\\n\\n◆ IF YOU KEEP TRACK OF YOUR SCREEN TIME WITH PERSONALIZED ACTIVITY TAGS ◆\\n\\niOS 17 limits modifying these tags from the home screen. From version 1.5.4, you have to go to \\\"Customization  \u003e Activities\\\" at the top-right corner of the home screen to change these tags. Unfortunately, all existing custom tags will be deleted after the update, sorry for the inconvenience.\\n\\n◆ IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* You can start several sessions with one focus filter now － Thanks to Cesar for suggesting this enhancement.\\n\\nEnjoying Jomo? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you like about it :)\\n\\nTake care,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-08-12\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-08-12T10:15:19Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.5.3\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New in this version:\\n\\n◆ IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* We’ve made a few improvements to our onboarding flow\\n\\nEnjoying Jomo? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you like about it :)\\n\\nTake care,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-07-21\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-07-21T16:54:57Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.5.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New in this version:\\n\\n◆ NEW JOURNAL SECTION IN TRENDS  ◆\\n\\nWe've updated your profile to include a “Journal” section in the trends card. Here, you'll find a weekly review of your feelings and activities related to your phone use. This new addition makes daily logging even more useful and relevant!\\n\\n◆ ADD MISSING APP ICONS IN SCREEN TIME REPORTS ◆ \\n\\nSome app icons are not visible in your screen time reports? You can now add them manually by going to Home \u003e Customization (icon in the top-right corner) \u003e App icons. \\n\\n◆ IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* We’ve made a few changes under the hood to make app limits more stable\u2028* We've added troubleshooting hints at several key points in the application\\n\\nEnjoying Jomo? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you like about it :)\\n\\nTake care,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-07-10\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-07-10T20:25:18Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.5.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New in this version:\\n\\n◆ UNPLUG DURING YOUR SUMMER HOLIDAY ◆\\n\\nThinking of (really) taking a break from work this summer? We're here to help! In this version, we are introducing a new session template called \\\"Summer 2023\\\". With it, you can easily switch off your work apps during your vacation, whether it's for 3 days, 7 days, or longer. We hope this will give you plenty of time to recharge and enjoy your loved ones.\\n\\nSo why wait? Embrace the Joy of Missing Out this summer!\\n\\n◆ HABITS SCHEDULING ◆ \\n\\nYou can now set specific hours for habits, like blocking apps from 6AM to 10AM if you haven't meditated yet. Thanks to Andrea, Jorge and many others for suggesting this!\\n\\n◆ IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* We've revamped the 'quick ideas' feature for sessions and conditions. It's more detailed now, including live events.\\n* App icons are no longer visible outside the home screen and trends section. This should help if you were having problems with the app freezing, for instance, on the breaks screen. If you want to see app icons, you can still do so by turning off the option under \\\"Focus \u003e Refresh \u003e Hide app icons\\\".\\n\\nEnjoying Jomo? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you like about it :)\\n\\nTake care,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-06-30\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-06-30T09:55:48Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.5.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New in this version:\\n\\n◆ UNPLUG DURING YOUR SUMMER HOLIDAY ◆\\n\\nThinking of (really) taking a break from work this summer? We're here to help! In this version, we are introducing a new session template called \\\"Summer 2023\\\". With it, you can easily switch off your work apps during your vacation, whether it's for 3 days, 7 days, or longer. We hope this will give you plenty of time to recharge and enjoy your loved ones.\\n\\nSo why wait? Embrace the Joy of Missing Out this summer!\\n\\n◆ HABITS SCHEDULING ◆ \\n\\nYou can now set specific hours for habits, like blocking apps from 6AM to 10AM if you haven't meditated yet. Thanks to Andrea, Jorge and many others for suggesting this!\\n\\n◆ IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* We've revamped the 'quick ideas' feature for sessions and conditions. It's more detailed now, including live events.\\n* App icons are no longer visible outside the home screen and trends section. This should help if you were having problems with the app freezing, for instance, on the breaks screen. If you want to see app icons, you can still do so by turning off the option under \\\"Focus \u003e Refresh \u003e Hide app icons\\\".\\n\\nEnjoying Jomo? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you like about it :)\\n\\nTake care,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-06-21\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-06-21T08:15:31Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.4.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New in this version:\\n\\n◆ SCREEN TIME JOURNALING ◆\\n\\nIn this update, we are introducing a brand new feature called \\\"Screen Time Journaling\\\". You can now rate the time spent on apps and websites, and link them to specific activities right from the \\\"Today\\\" tab.\\n\\nAfter rating a few apps, you will have access to a daily summary of your feelings towards your screen time (are you happy with it or not?). You will also have a clear picture of the activities you engaged in on your phone, empowering you to make changes.\\n\\nYou'll receive a notification at 8:30 p.m. every evening, inviting you to complete your feelings for the day.\\n\\nWe're the first app in the world to try out this approach on screen time management, and we are incredibly excited to hear your feedback.\\n\\n◆ HEALTHY ALTERNATIVES ◆ \\n\\nYou will now be suggested healthy alternatives right when you need them (for ex., before taking a break from your session). These alternatives are concrete and entirely customizable: looking at family photos, doing sports, calling a friend, drinking water, reading a book.\\n\\n◆ NEW VISUAL IDENTITY ◆\\n\\nAt Jomo, we're deeply optimistic and we are looking to help as many people as possible be happy with their screen time in the long term. But our design didn't reflect these values enough so we changed it. We've made our brand identity sharper and more confident, so that it better reflects our vision!\\n\\n◆ IMPROVEMENTS ◆\\n\\n* A lot of new options for session breaks! You can now set a maximum number of breaks in a 24-hour interval, set a cooldown period between 2 breaks as well as configure a delay before being able to press \\\"Unlock\\\" on the start break screen. (Thanks Ingo for your feedback)\\n* We have added a \\\"Quick ideas\\\" section in both condition and session screens\\n* You can now hide specific apps instead of shielding them when they are blocked by a condition or session. Go to \\\"Settings \u003e Hidden apps\\\" to select apps you would prefer to hide. (Thanks Jorge, Tom and many others for your feedback)\\n\\nEnjoying Jomo? Rate the app 5 stars and tell us what you like about it :)\\n\\nTake care,\\nLaureline \u0026 Thomas\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-06-02\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-06-02T13:20:09Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.3.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This update brings improvements to make your Jomo experience even greater.\\n\\nIn this version:\\n- Strict mode has been improved\\n\\nWe hope you'll enjoy it!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-05-17\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-05-17T07:35:13Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.3.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This update brings improvements to make your Jomo experience even greater.\\n\\nIn this version:\\n- Many of you requested the possibility to create multiple budgets, such as one for weekdays and another for weekends. Now, you can do that!\\n- You can now block any website through a custom list. They will be blocked on all browsers (not limited to Safari).\\n- Students, this is for you: although the year is nearly finished, prepare early for the next school year and enjoy a 50% discount on Jomo Plus!\\n\\nWe hope you'll enjoy it!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-05-06\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-05-06T07:37:22Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.3.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This update brings improvements to make your Jomo experience even greater.\\n\\nIn this version:\\n- We've completely redesigned the interface for creating conditions and sessions. Discover proven and easy-to-implement methods to reduce distractions.\\n- Improved strict mode\\n\\nWe hope you'll enjoy it!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-04-26\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-04-26T06:51:59Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.2.8\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This update brings improvements to make your Jomo experience even greater.\\n\\nIn this version:\\n- We’ve improved the breaks experience! You now have to wait for a few seconds before taking a break and there will be increasing delays before you can take another one.\\n- We've added a few points of explanation about how screen time is calculated on Jomo (and how it differs a bit from Apple’s).\\n- The configuration of the protection for a session has been adjusted. It is now easier to set up breaks as you wish.\\n- You can now access a troubleshooting section in the Focus tab (just tap the reload icon on the top-right corner). You can reset blocking if you encounter an issue.\\n\\nWe hope you'll enjoy it!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-03-29\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-03-29T19:41:29Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.2.7\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This update brings improvements to make your Jomo experience even greater.\\n\\nIn this version:\\n- We’ve improved the breaks experience! You now have to wait for a few seconds before taking a break and there will be increasing delays before you can take another one.\\n- We've added a few points of explanation about how screen time is calculated on Jomo (and how it differs a bit from Apple’s).\\n- The configuration of the protection for a session has been adjusted. It is now easier to set up breaks as you wish.\\n- You can now access a troubleshooting section in the Focus tab (just tap the reload icon on the top-right corner). You can reset blocking if you encounter an issue.\\n\\nWe hope you'll enjoy it!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-03-25\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-03-25T09:42:17Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.2.6\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This update brings improvements to make your Jomo experience even greater.\\n\\nIn this version:\\n- We’ve improved the breaks experience! You now have to wait for a few seconds before taking a break and there will be increasing delays before you can take another one.\\n- We've added a few points of explanation about how screen time is calculated on Jomo (and how it differs a bit from Apple’s).\\n- The configuration of the protection for a session has been adjusted. It is now easier to set up breaks as you wish.\\n- You can now access a troubleshooting section in the Focus tab (just tap the reload icon on the top-right corner). You can reset blocking if you encounter an issue.\\n\\nWe hope you'll enjoy it!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-03-23\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-03-23T08:36:15Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.2.5\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This update brings improvements to make your Jomo experience even greater.\\n\\nIn this version:\\n- Jomo is changing its home screen! We redesigned it to make it more insightful and easier to navigate.\\n- The Jomo Score is evolving. It is now a number that evaluates how your phone use matches up with your values and goals (screen time budget, etc.).\\n- You can now customize the categorization (productive, distracting, neutral) of each app or website so that it better suits your preferences.\\n\\nWe hope you'll enjoy it!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-03-15\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-03-15T08:18:42Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.2.4\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This update brings improvements to make your Jomo experience even greater.\\n\\nIn this version:\\n- Jomo is changing its home screen! We redesigned it to make it more insightful and easier to navigate.\\n- The Jomo Score is evolving. It is now a number that evaluates how your phone use matches up with your values and goals (screen time budget, etc.).\\n- You can now customize the categorization (productive, distracting, neutral) of each app or website so that it better suits your preferences.\\n\\nWe hope you'll enjoy it!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-03-01\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-03-01T09:05:09Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.2.3\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This update brings improvements to make your Jomo experience even greater.\\n\\nIn this version:\\n- Fixed an issue where screen time goals were not updated correctly\\n\\nWe hope you'll enjoy it!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-02-02\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-02-02T09:10:45Z\"}],\"minimumXROSVersion\":\"1.0\",\"isXROSCompatible\":true,\"messagesScreenshots\":{},\"hasSafariExtension\":false,\"requiresGameController\":false,\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1609960918\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=863373051\",\"type\":\"get\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.00\",\"price\":0,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"iosSoftware\",\"size\":139307008}]},{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1609960918\u0026pricingParameters=SWUPD\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=863373051\",\"type\":\"update\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.00\",\"price\":0,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"iosSoftware\",\"size\":139307008}]}],\"requires32bit\":false,\"releaseDate\":\"2022-10-16\",\"hasInAppPurchases\":true,\"bundleId\":\"com.jomo.Jomo\",\"hasMessagesExtension\":false,\"artwork\":{\"width\":1024,\"height\":1024,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple116/v4/98/d6/1a/98d61a79-9c8b-6333-a5ac-6761a3310095/AppIcon-1x_U007emarketing-0-10-0-85-220.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"9bb0ff\",\"textColor1\":\"1c1c1c\",\"textColor2\":\"1d1f24\",\"textColor3\":\"353a49\",\"textColor4\":\"363c50\"},\"videoPreviewsByType\":{},\"privacyPolicyUrl\":\"https://getjomo.notion.site/Privacy-Policy-7265a825c9fe4b289229cec614a169fd\",\"supportURLForLanguage\":\"https://help.jomo.so/en/\",\"isStandaloneForWatchOS\":false,\"isHiddenFromSpringboard\":false,\"isDeliveredInIOSAppForWatchOS\":false,\"editorialArtwork\":{\"contentIconTrimmedMonochrome\":{\"width\":1048,\"height\":1080,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features116/v4/6e/e2/e7/6ee2e7db-bf98-0d30-7adf-15aa80debeb5/721e011e-109f-4227-8978-1f8c6071c48f.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"000000\",\"textColor1\":\"f2f2f2\",\"textColor2\":\"e5e5e5\",\"textColor3\":\"c1c1c1\",\"textColor4\":\"b7b7b7\"},\"contentIconTrimmed\":{\"width\":1048,\"height\":1080,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features126/v4/09/15/89/091589bc-f33b-2d71-9e77-2ef3729cd955/abc2adb6-5a59-47b0-b8f5-84523bdd6bd8.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"0092ff\",\"textColor1\":\"00070c\",\"textColor2\":\"000e19\",\"textColor3\":\"00233d\",\"textColor4\":\"002947\"},\"brandLogo\":{\"width\":1080,\"height\":1080,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features116/v4/1c/2b/7c/1c2b7cc6-e029-9bf9-