\":\"The following data may be collected but it is not linked to your identity:\",\"dataCategories\":[{\"dataCategory\":\"Location\",\"identifier\":\"LOCATION\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"User Content\",\"identifier\":\"USER_CONTENT\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Identifiers\",\"identifier\":\"IDENTIFIERS\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Usage Data\",\"identifier\":\"USAGE_DATA\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Diagnostics\",\"identifier\":\"DIAGNOSTICS\"}]}]},\"contentRatingsBySystem\":{\"appsApple\":{\"name\":\"4+\",\"value\":100,\"rank\":1}},\"deviceFamilies\":[\"iphone\",\"ipad\",\"ipod\"],\"supportsStreamlinedBuy\":false,\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/superlist-tasks-lists/id1547585270\",\"userRating\":{\"value\":4,\"ratingCount\":59,\"ratingCountList\":[4,6,11,4,34],\"ariaLabelForRatings\":\"4.0 stars\"},\"name\":\"Superlist - Tasks \u0026 Lists\",\"genreDisplayName\":\"Productivity\",\"isPreorder\":false,\"isIOSBinaryMacOSCompatible\":false,\"artistName\":\"Superlist Software GmbH\",\"reviewsRestricted\":false,\"requirementsByDeviceFamily\":{\"iphone\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPhone\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 14.0 or later.\"},\"ipad\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPad\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iPadOS 14.0 or later.\"},\"ipod\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPod touch\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 14.0 or later.\"}},\"platformAttributes\":{\"ios\":{\"minimumMacOSVersion\":\"11.0\",\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Superlist is the home for all your lists. From team projects to grocery runs, get it all done in one place. Intuitive, private by default, and integrated with everything you already use, it’s built to work the way you do. With Superlist, you can do it all: Create to-do lists, capture thoughts or detailed notes, assign tasks to teammates, and everything in between. Whether you’re coordinating with a co-worker or planning an upcoming vacation, manage your whole life, from work to home, in Superlist.\\n\\nBy the way, Superlist also works great your 2024 resolutions. Don’t just create a list of resolutions – set them to repeat, add reminders, and more.\"},\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"requiredCapabilitiesForRealityDevice\":\"arm64 \",\"websiteUrl\":\"https://www.superlist.com\",\"versionHistory\":[{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"We've got wunderful news: Today, we're releasing Superlist 1.0 – the new home to all your lists.\\n\\nTo-do lists, shopping lists, reading lists, playlists…we all work with lists every day. \\n\\nSuperlist brings a modern approach to organizing your work, seamlessly blending personal and professional tasks so you can get it all done in one place. It’s integrated with all the tools you already love to use to keep your life in sync. And our powerful AI features make going through your to do’s much faster and easier, giving you the ultimate luxury in today's fast-paced world: More time to focus on what really matters.\\n\\nSuperlist 1.0 is just the beginning. We have plenty of exciting features in the pipeline, but with this release, we’re ready to get new eyes on the product (and of course, to make it possible for all of our old Wunderlist users to take Superlist for a spin!)\\n‍\\nP.S. Don't forget to vote for us on Product Hunt!\\n\\nCheck out the full release at superlist.com/updates \",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-02-13\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-02-13T07:34:19Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"0.36.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Discover 13 new list images. We also brought back some nostalgia from Wunderlist.\\n\\nWith the newly implemented toggle, you can easily show and hide lists from the sidebar. Just flip the switch for the spaces you want (or don't want) to see.\\n\\nCreate new lists directly from your team space. Note: the lists remain private unless shared. \\n\\nMove the ownership of lists to a team space. Simply, select the space in the dropdown from the share module at the top. \\n\\nBetter offline detection. \\n\\nFixed some synchronisation issues.\\n\\nCheck out the full release at superlist.com/updates \",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-02-01\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-02-01T07:58:03Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"0.36\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Removed the “More” option from the sidebar. You can now see all available tabs at a single glance.\\n\\nImproved the performance of large lists. When opening a list with A LOT of tasks in them, it sometimes took waaay too long to load. We fixed this and it should feel much snappier now.\\n\\nRescheduling a repeating task now shows you a small confirmation. \\n\\nMade a couple of smaller tweaks and improvements to text editing and selection. \\n\\nCheck out the full release at superlist.com/updates \",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-01-24\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-01-24T09:10:18Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"0.35\",\"releaseNotes\":\"When sorting tasks in the Inbox, Today or Tasks tab by due date, they will now appear in order of the due date instead of creation date.\\n\\nSetting a task to Next week now by default sets the coming Monday as the due date. \\n\\nFixed a sync issue in lists. Using certain emojis previously caused sync issues in lists. This should no longer be an issue. \\n\\nFixed an issue where parts of the app wouldn’t show on smaller screens. For example, with an iPhone SE, the reminder time picker would be cut out. This was adjusted and you now see everything you should see.\\n\\nThe Done button on the Teams page has been fixed. \\n\\nCheck out the full release at superlist.com/updates \",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-01-17\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-01-17T18:56:58Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"0.33\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Content indicator position was adjusted to feel more natural and not cut-off as in the previous version. \\n\\nIf you are loving Superlist, you can now leave a rating for us in the app store directly from your settings menu. Just click on your profile icon and select the rating option. We appreciate the love!\\n\\nWe fixed the issue, where sharing, unsharing and then resharing a list would causes issues with the list content.\\n\\nRe-adding team members to a list now allows them to view the content correctly. \\n\\nOpening lists with a large amount of completed, uncompleted, or hidden completed tasks is now faster.\\n\\nLonger team names are now displayed correctly.\\n\\nCheck out the full release at superlist.com/updates \",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-12-19\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-12-19T19:08:19Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"0.32\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Content indicators are now also available on mobile.\\n\\nImproved loading time when opening lists with a large number of hidden tasks. \\n\\nFixed an issue where changing the due date after a due time has been selected would clear the former. \\n\\nFixed the issue where our Help Centre was not accessible via mobile. \\n\\nCheck out the full release at superlist.com/updates \",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-12-06\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-12-06T07:51:53Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"0.31\",\"releaseNotes\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2023-11-23\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-11-23T09:04:13Z\"}],\"minimumXROSVersion\":\"1.0\",\"isXROSCompatible\":false,\"editorialNotes\":{\"tagline\":\"Log notes, tasks and more\"},\"messagesScreenshots\":{},\"hasSafariExtension\":false,\"requiresGameController\":false,\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1547585270\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=863678027\",\"type\":\"get\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.00\",\"price\":0,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"iosSoftware\",\"size\":84574208}]},{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1547585270\u0026pricingParameters=SWUPD\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=863678027\",\"type\":\"update\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.00\",\"price\":0,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"iosSoftware\",\"size\":84574208}]}],\"requires32bit\":false,\"releaseDate\":\"2023-11-23\",\"hasInAppPurchases\":false,\"bundleId\":\"com.superlist.superlist\",\"hasMessagesExtension\":false,\"artwork\":{\"width\":1024,\"height\":1024,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple126/v4/af/37/1e/af371e30-e73c-c136-d68b-6415b2154227/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007epad-0-10-0-sRGB-85-220.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"b3230d\",\"textColor1\":\"ffc7ba\",\"textColor2\":\"ffb49c\",\"textColor3\":\"efa697\",\"textColor4\":\"ef977f\"},\"videoPreviewsByType\":{},\"privacyPolicyUrl\":\"https://www.superlist.com/privacy-policy\",\"supportURLForLanguage\":\"https://help.superlist.com/en/\",\"isStandaloneForWatchOS\":false,\"isHiddenFromSpringboard\":false,\"isDeliveredInIOSAppForWatchOS\":false,\"editorialArtwork\":{\"contentIconTrimmedMonochrome\":{\"width\":1048,\"height\":1080,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features116/v4/6e/e2/e7/6ee2e7db-bf98-0d30-7adf-15aa80debeb5/721e011e-109f-4227-8978-1f8c6071c48f.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"000000\",\"textColor1\":\"f2f2f2\",\"textColor2\":\"e5e5e5\",\"textColor3\":\"c1c1c1\",\"textColor4\":\"b7b7b7\"},\"contentIconTrimmed\":{\"width\":1048,\"height\":1080,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features126/v4/09/15/89/091589bc-f33b-2d71-9e77-2ef3729cd955/abc2adb6-5a59-47b0-b8f5-84523bdd6bd8.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"0092ff\",\"textColor1\":\"00070c\",\"textColor2\":\"000e19\",\"textColor3\":\"00233d\",\"textColor4\":\"002947\"},\"brandLogo\":{\"width\":1080,\"height\":1080,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features116/v4/1c/2b/7c/1c2b7cc6-e029-9bf9-f26f-4b5f533ee2fc/af8e3a5e-dba7-4ad7-9b94-9340366eab93.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"000000\",\"textColor1\":\"efefef\",\"textColor2\":\"dfdfdf\",\"textColor3\":\"b5b5b5\",\"textColor4\":\"a9a9a9\"},\"subscriptionHero\":{\"width\":4320,\"height\":1080,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features116/v4/35/52/6d/35526dbb-6831-764f-b6f7-978fa5e423f9/c66c3902-6d7a-47e7-9aba-4b3f82e6dd3e.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"242336\",\"textColor1\":\"f771